msgid ""
"Open images in a window overlay when clicked. Turn it off on Carousel or "
"Showcase to keep the gallery on the page without the overlay."
msgstr ""
"Ṣii awọn aworan ninu fẹlẹfẹlẹ ferese nigbati a ba tẹ. Pa a mọ ni Carousel "
"tabi Showcase lati jẹ ki galari wa lori oju-iwe laisi fẹlẹfẹlẹ."

